        "TileImage": "$($repository 80051c02-e026-40fe-970a-7b7aaa62302c).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned the first set of High Value Targets (HVTs) in the slums of Mumbai, India. Below are the listed targets and the preferred method for dealing with them;\r\rEliminate &quot;The Kashmirian&quot; with his own sniper rifle.\rEliminate Gilford Bootyswang by electricution.\rEliminate Kafe Hudsa in an accidental explosion.\rEliminate Kharisma Haasan with the industrial fan.\rEliminate Babu Raav by drowning him. \r\rLots of eyes everywhere, so avoid non-target casualties.\r\rGood luck!\rReapingZ",
